a strong showdown hand with Top Pair, but the board texture (4 cards to a straight) makes betting risky. The opponent's passivity suggests I can win at showdown, and checking minimizes loss if they lucked into a straight with a 5. Preserving the chip lead and pot control is the optimal strategy here.\n\nAnswer: 0"}
